<title>CROATIA: Croatia Sept currency reserves shrink to $4.37 bln.</title>
<headline>Croatia Sept currency reserves shrink to $4.37 bln.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Croatia issued the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> CROATIA CURRENCY RESERVES    SEPTEMBER     AUGUST     SEPT '95</p>
<p> Total (million USD)	     4,367.4     4,426.3     3,001.7</p>
<p> National Bank of Croatia	2,295.1     2,331.1     1,943.8</p>
<p> Commercial banks		  2,072.3     2,095.2     1,057.9</p>
<p>NOTE -- The central bank's hard currency reserves shrank 1.5 percent in September from August and commercial banks' reserves 1.1 percent.</p>
<p>-- Zagreb Newsroom, 385-1-4557075</p>
</text>
